# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto
stubbed_testing_data/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# The stub catalogue is documentation rather than recorded data: it is edited by hand and
# reviewed in diffs, and as an LFS pointer every edit on two branches conflicts as a pair of
# opaque hashes that git cannot merge. "!attr" unsets the rule above rather than setting it
# false, which is what takes the path out of the filter entirely.
stubbed_testing_data/README.md !filter !diff !merge text
